,"pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4eb741033b85a624e205.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n17234-1-9-2","ko":"저는 노란색을 좋아해서 개나리가 가장 좋아요.","zh":"我喜欢黄色，所以最喜欢连翘。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"노란색을","meaning":"黄色，鹅黄色，嫩黄色","explanation":"노란색：黄色，鹅黄色，嫩黄色；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"노란색","audio":"/audio/08cc0870bd508821acc6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17234","senseId":"1","lemma":"노란색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아해서","meaning":"喜欢","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"개나리가","meaning":"连翘，迎春花","explanation":"개나리：连翘，迎春花；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"개나리","audio":"/audio/301d01c0c3f97f0b7598.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64519","senseId":"1","lemma":"개나리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가장","meaning":"最","explanation":"가장：最","readings":[{"term":"가장","audio":"/audio/8fd32c9572450a80df7d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26795","senseId":"1","lemma":"가장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아요.","meaning":"喜爱，喜欢","explanation":"좋다：喜爱，喜欢；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"10","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"08cc0870bd508821","term":"노란색","zh":"黄色，鹅黄色，嫩黄色","audio":"/audio/08cc0870bd508821acc6.mp3","entryId":"17234","definition":"与小鸡或香蕉相同的颜色。","pronunciation":["노란색"]